            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xs0RdCsD1oY12MxT8TnlqbTNg54\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQ0Hdy1K4o2GNUxnSFJlxo8cgjf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ser1dOBfVoAXY1xqSn5lu2iagQg\">Overall, while the number of immigrants to the USA declined sharply after 1992, the figures for both Canada and Australia remained relatively stable throughout the period. Additionally, the USA consistently maintained the highest numbers of immigrants among the three countries.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
